Perfect! Now I have all the information. Let me compile a comprehensive response:

## Microsoft.Agents.AI API Surface for .NET 10 Agentic Workflow

Based on exploration of **Microsoft.Agents.AI v1.9.0** and **Microsoft.Extensions.AI v10.6.0**, here's the complete API surface you need:

---

## **1. CORE AGENT CLASS: ChatClientAgent**

### **Constructor Signatures:**
```csharp
// Constructor 1: Detailed parameters
public ChatClientAgent(
    IChatClient chatClient,
    string? instructions,
    string? name,
    string? description,
    IList<AITool>? tools,
    ILoggerFactory? loggerFactory,
    IServiceProvider? services)

// Constructor 2: Options-based (recommended)
public ChatClientAgent(
    IChatClient chatClient,
    ChatClientAgentOptions options,
    ILoggerFactory? loggerFactory,
    IServiceProvider? services)
```

**Location:** `Microsoft.Agents.AI` namespace

---

## **2. KEY OPTIONS CLASSES**

### **ChatClientAgentOptions**
Properties:
- `string Id` - Agent identifier
- `string Name` - Agent name
- `string Description` - Agent description  
- `string Instructions` - System instructions
- `IList<AITool> Tools` - Available tools
- Other agent-specific metadata

### **ChatClientAgentRunOptions** (extends `AgentRunOptions`)
Properties:
- `ChatOptions ChatOptions` - Per-invocation chat configuration
- `Func<IChatClient, IChatClient> ChatClientFactory` - Optional chat client decorator

### **AgentRunOptions** (base class)
Properties:
- `AgentContinuationToken ContinuationToken` - Resume background operations
- `bool AllowBackgroundResponses` - Enable async background operations
- `AdditionalPropertiesDictionary AdditionalProperties` - Custom metadata
- `ChatResponseFormat ResponseFormat` - Response format (Text/JSON)

---

## **3. RUNNING THE AGENT**

### **Main RunAsync Methods** (from `AIAgent` base class):

```csharp
// Overloads (all return Task<AgentResponse>):
Task<AgentResponse> RunAsync(
    string userMessage,
    AgentSession session,
    AgentRunOptions options,
    CancellationToken cancellationToken)

Task<AgentResponse> RunAsync(
    ChatMessage message,
    AgentSession session,
    AgentRunOptions options,
    CancellationToken cancellationToken)

Task<AgentResponse> RunAsync(
    IEnumerable<ChatMessage> messages,  // Primary method
    AgentSession session,
    AgentRunOptions options,
    CancellationToken cancellationToken)

// Streaming variant:
IAsyncEnumerable<AgentResponseUpdate> RunStreamingAsync(
    IEnumerable<ChatMessage> messages,
    AgentSession session,
    AgentRunOptions options,
    CancellationToken cancellationToken)
```

---

## **4. AGENT SESSION & RESPONSE**

### **AgentSession**
- Base abstraction for conversation state
- Created via: `Task<AgentSession> CreateSessionAsync(CancellationToken)`
- Contains:
  - Conversation history
  - Conversation ID reference
  - Behaviors for history compaction, memory management

### **AgentResponse**
```csharp
public class AgentResponse
{
    public IList<ChatMessage> Messages { get; }  // Response messages
    public string Text { get; }                   // Concatenated text
    public override string ToString();             // Text result
    // ... other properties
}
```

---

## **5. TOOL DEFINITION & REGISTRATION**

### **AITool (Struct)**
```csharp
public struct AITool
{
    public string Name { get; set; }
    public string Description { get; set; }
    public AdditionalPropertiesDictionary AdditionalProperties { get; set; }

    // Service retrieval:
    public object GetService(Type serviceType, object serviceKey);
    public TService GetService<TService>(object serviceKey);
}
```

### **AIFunction (Abstract Base)**
Represents an invokable function. Key methods:
```csharp
public abstract class AIFunction
{
    public virtual MethodInfo UnderlyingMethod { get; }
    public virtual JsonSerializerOptions JsonSerializerOptions { get; }

    public Task<object> InvokeAsync(
        AIFunctionArguments arguments,
        CancellationToken cancellationToken)

    public AIFunctionDeclaration AsDeclarationOnly()
}
```

### **AIFunctionFactory** (Static Factory)
```csharp
public static class AIFunctionFactory
{
    // Create from delegate:
    public static AIFunction Create(
        Delegate method,
        AIFunctionFactoryOptions options)

    public static AIFunction Create(
        Delegate method,
        string name,
        string description,
        JsonSerializerOptions serializerOptions)

    // Create from MethodInfo:
    public static AIFunction Create(
        MethodInfo method,
        object instance,
        AIFunctionFactoryOptions options)

    // Create JSON schema declaration:
    public static AIFunctionDeclaration CreateDeclaration(
        string name,
        string description,
        JsonElement jsonSchema,
        JsonElement? returnSchema)
}
```

### **AIFunctionFactoryOptions**
```csharp
public class AIFunctionFactoryOptions
{
    public string Name { get; set; }
    public string Description { get; set; }
    public JsonSerializerOptions SerializerOptions { get; set; }
    public JsonSchemaCreateOptions JsonSchemaCreateOptions { get; set; }
    public bool ExcludeResultSchema { get; set; }
    public Func<object, AIFunctionArguments> MarshalResult { get; set; }
}
```

### **AIFunctionArguments**
```csharp
public abstract class AIFunctionArguments
{
    // Dictionary-like access for function parameters
    public abstract object this[string name] { get; set; }
}
```

---

## **6. CHAT MESSAGE & OPTIONS**

### **ChatMessage**
```csharp
public class ChatMessage
{
    public ChatMessage()                              // Defaults to User role
    public ChatMessage(ChatRole role, string text)
    public ChatMessage(ChatRole role, IList<AIContent> contents)

    public ChatRole Role { get; set; }
    public string Text { get; }                       // Concatenated text
    public IList<AIContent> Contents { get; set; }   // Message content
    public string AuthorName { get; set; }
    public DateTimeOffset? CreatedAt { get; set; }

    public ChatMessage Clone()
}
```

### **ChatOptions**
```csharp
public class ChatOptions
{
    // Tool configuration:
    public IList<AITool> Tools { get; set; }         // Available tools
    public ChatToolMode ToolMode { get; set; }       // Auto/Required/None
    public bool AllowMultipleToolCalls { get; set; }

    // Model behavior:
    public string ModelId { get; set; }
    public double? Temperature { get; set; }
    public int? MaxOutputTokens { get; set; }
    public double? TopP { get; set; }
    public int? TopK { get; set; }
    public double? FrequencyPenalty { get; set; }
    public double? PresencePenalty { get; set; }
    public long? Seed { get; set; }

    // Response control:
    public ChatResponseFormat ResponseFormat { get; set; }  // Text/JSON
    public IList<string> StopSequences { get; set; }

    // Instructions and conversation:
    public string Instructions { get; set; }
    public string ConversationId { get; set; }

    // Background operations:
    public bool AllowBackgroundResponses { get; set; }
    public AgentContinuationToken ContinuationToken { get; set; }

    // Custom properties:
    public AdditionalPropertiesDictionary AdditionalProperties { get; set; }
}
```

### **ChatRole** (Enum)
```csharp
public enum ChatRole
{
    System,      // System message
    User,        // User message
    Assistant,   // AI response
    Tool         // Tool result
}
```

---

## **7. ICHATCLIENT INTERFACE**

```csharp
public interface IChatClient : IDisposable
{
    Task<ChatResponse> GetResponseAsync(
        IEnumerable<ChatMessage> messages,
        ChatOptions options,
        CancellationToken cancellationToken)

    IAsyncEnumerable<ChatResponseUpdate> GetStreamingResponseAsync(
        IEnumerable<ChatMessage> messages,
        ChatOptions options,
        CancellationToken cancellationToken)

    TService GetService<TService>(object serviceKey)
        where TService : class;
}
```

---

## **8. AGENT BUILDER PATTERN (Advanced)**

```csharp
public class AIAgentBuilder
{
    // Initialize with inner agent:
    public AIAgentBuilder(AIAgent innerAgent)
    public AIAgentBuilder(Func<IServiceProvider, AIAgent> innerAgentFactory)

    // Build final agent:
    public AIAgent Build(IServiceProvider services)

    // Decorate with middleware:
    public AIAgentBuilder Use(
        Func<AIAgent, AIAgent> middleware)

    public AIAgentBuilder Use(
        Func<AIAgent, IServiceProvider, AIAgent> middleware)

    // Add context providers:
    public AIAgentBuilder UseAIContextProviders(
        params MessageAIContextProvider[] providers)
}
```

---

## **9. NAMESPACE IMPORTS**

```csharp
// Core agent API
using Microsoft.Agents.AI;

// Chat client, messages, tools, functions
using Microsoft.Extensions.AI;

// Logging (optional but recommended)
using Microsoft.Extensions.Logging;

// Dependency injection (optional)
using Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection;

// JSON handling
using System.Text.Json;
using System.Reflection;
```

---

## **10. COMPLETE MINIMAL WORKFLOW EXAMPLE**

